1. handling closed source
   the following sources are closed, and prebuilt binaries are put in the directory. so if you'd like to modify source, you may need to modify makefile and use the new binary as prebuilt one.
   - ./src/router/emf
   - ./src/router/wps
   - ./src/router/nas
   - ./src/router/eapd
   - ./src/router/libbcmcrypto
   - ./src-rt/wl
   - ./src-rt/et
 
